": "希爾", "text": "Yeah...♥ I really like going all out like this too...♥", "text_zh": "嗯——♥希爾也很喜歡這樣盡全力的性愛喔……♥", "voice_clip": "vic_hstory_ct028_hcg1_053", "voice_url": "/audio/voice/vic_hstory_ct028_hcg1_053", "bgm": "music_sex_02", "anim": null, "sfx_tracks": []}, {"speaker": "Sylv", "speaker_zh": "希爾", "text": "During your stay... if you ever need help \"relieving\" your stress, you can always come to me for help, hehe♥", "text_zh": "在這裡的時間……如果還需要排解壓力的「自慰」，還是可以再找希爾幫忙呦，嘻嘻♥", "voice_clip": "vic_hstory_ct028_hcg1_054", "voice_url": "/audio/voice/vic_hstory_ct028_hcg1_054", "bgm": "music_sex_02", "anim": null, "sfx_tracks": []}, {"speaker": "Rafael", "speaker_zh": "菈法瑞", "text": "Huh! Your H-Help?!", "text_zh": "唔！幫……幫忙？！", "voice_clip": "vic_hstory_ct028_hcg1_055", "voice_url": "/audio/voice/vic_hstory_ct028_hcg1_055", "bgm": "music_sex_02", "anim": null, "sfx_tracks": []}, {"speaker": "Sylv", "speaker_zh": "希爾", "text": "Hehe♥ There's no need to be shy.#Aren't we already closer than before?♥", "text_zh": "嘻嘻♥害羞什麼嘛——？#我們不都是這樣那樣的關係了嗎♥", "voice_clip": "vic_hstory_ct028_hcg1_056", "voice_url": "/audio/voice/vic_hstory_ct028_hcg1_056", "bgm": "music_sex_02", "anim": null, "sfx_tracks": []}, {"speaker": "Sylv", "speaker_zh": "希爾", "text": "Come on! Let's go another round!", "text_zh": "來吧來吧！緊接著再來一次！", "voice_clip": "vic_hstory_ct028_hcg1_057", "voice_url": "/audio/voice/vic_hstory_ct028_hcg1_057", "bgm": "music_sex_02", "anim": null, "sfx_tracks": []}, {"speaker": "Rafael", "speaker_zh": "菈法瑞", "text": "Hah♥ Please give me a moment, Sylv!♥", "text_zh": "哈啊♥希爾等等啊……！♥", "voice_clip": "vic_hstory_ct028_hcg1_058", "voice_url": "/audio/voice/vic_hstory_ct028_hcg1_058", "bgm": "music_sex_02", "anim": null, "sfx_tracks": []}], "touch_voices": [{"name": "Touch Dialogue 1", "clip": "vic_ct028_tou_01", "url": "/audio/voice/vic_ct028_tou_01", "tag": "Touch"}, {"name": "Touch Dialogue 2", "clip": "vic_ct028_tou_02", "url": "/audio/voice/vic_ct028_tou_02", "tag": "Touch"}, {"name": "B